WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A fixed kitchen counter shot: the subject enters, starts the machine and the window causes a small exposure adjustment.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
A handheld top view follows the beans and grinder; the close grinder sound leads the scene.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
A close tamp and soft metal tap briefly lose focus before finding the coffee bed again.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
The portafilter locks in and extraction starts, joined by hard cuts and sound continuity.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Espresso drips into the cup in real time while focus moves between stream and rim.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
Milk is poured into a steel pitcher; the intimate liquid and metal sounds remain present.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Steam creates a vortex as autofocus hunts between the wand and the milk.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
The pitcher is tapped, rotated and poured; a ceramic clink becomes the edit point.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.050
The subject takes a sip, smiles briefly and covers the lens; a click ends the recording.
